- **Strengths**: Provides direct evidence of how teachers integrate digital tools into their teaching in real-time.
- **Limitations**: May not capture reported perceptions or personal insights; can be time-consuming to observe many classrooms.
- **Example Context**: A study might observe geography lessons to see the actual use of digital tools and how they enhance or hinder learning.

